+- The mounted candidate tree has pipeline tree hash
+  `80ef229b2f43b1b96fed636e558312340d4fbbc98de4106b1375a738768bfeb4`,
+  matching `generation-result.json` and `invocation.json`.
+- The structured trace tree hash is
